2026-10-30T00:29:56.0423871Z [36;1mcurl -fsSL -o pinned.tar.gz "$base/linux.x64.ailang.tar.gz"[0m
2026-10-30T00:29:56.0424268Z [36;1mcurl -fsSL -o pinned.tar.gz.sha256 "$base/linux.x64.ailang.tar.gz.sha256"[0m
